{
  "description": "A credential's connection URLs the backup encryption key and `metrics_prefix`, which the spec types as plain strings; the spec's own description of `metrics_prefix` says it may hold an API key. STACKIT's Terraform provider marks `uri` and `password` sensitive (docs/resources/rabbitmq_credential.md, read 2026-11-01), and AMQP and HTTP URLs of this kind carry the user and password, so `uris`, `http_api_uri`, `http_api_uris`, `management`, `mqtt` and `stomp` get the same treatment. Nothing on the wire changes.",
